```
Phase 1 (4w) ──→ Phase 2 (4w) ──→ Phase 3 (4w) ──→ Phase 6 (4w)
                                ├──→ Phase 4 (4w) ──┘
                                └──→ Phase 5 (4w) ──┘
```

- Phase 1 ships CLI with **minimal dashboard landing page** (savings preview) — not invisible
- Phase 2 ships cloud pipeline + dashboard — first revenue at Week 8
