### Whole-Plan Consistency Sweep

**Changes applied across all files:**
- plan.md: tech stack tiered (MVP vs scale), timeline compressed, revenue targets adjusted
- Phase 1: SQLite replaces LMDB + mmap, 10-15 filters not 40+, port not fork, 2 platforms not 6, protobuf versioning contract defined
- Phase 2: no NATS (direct ClickHouse), no K8s (Railway/Fly.io), no Stripe (manual billing), tenant isolation via Go middleware not row policies, short-lived certs, server overrides tenant_id
- Phase 3: NATS introduced here with MaxDeliver + DLQ, waste detector uses persistent checkpointing
- Phase 4: FileSystemProvider approach marked INVALID, needs R&D spike for alternative interception
- Phase 5: scanner runs on raw output before compression, policy cache signed
- Phase 6: US + EU only, no APAC, no migration tool, single ClickHouse Cloud per region

**Unresolved contradictions:** None — all phase files updated consistently.
